Hello?

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:24.720
Tempura 
soba 
delivery, 
please

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:32.800
No signal

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:29.040
Otherwise, you can't call for 
help when you're in trouble.

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:32.230
And you can't look up information online.

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:36.850
Let friends and family 
know where you're going

00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:37.130
<i>Two: let friends and family 
know where you're going.</i>

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:38.810
Especially if you're going by yourself.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:42.110
Do thorough research

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:42.460
<i>Three: do thorough research.</i>

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:44.460
Like about where the campsite is?

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:46.000
Among other things.

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:48.480
Sometimes the faucets 
don't work in the winter.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:50.410
And sometimes the toilets are nasty.

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:52.620
Yeah, that would suck...

