specialty called shigure-yaki.</i>

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:28.090
<i>She said you can get it here!</i>

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:28.940
Wait...

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:31.200
It's so crowded!

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:33.770
Y-Yakisoba...

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:34.950
Gurrrrgle

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:37.200
<b>Narada no Sato

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:43.210
<b>Lake Narada
Hot Springs</b>

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:43.210
<b><u>Caution</u> 
School Bus Parking</b>

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:42.300
<i>It's Nara in Yamanashi.</i>

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:48.180
<i>Made it to Lake Narada Hot Springs.</i>

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:52.920
<i>Isn't this the same car Sakura-san drives?</i>

00:15:54.440 --> 00:15:55.700
<i>No way, right?</i>

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:01.730
No parking ahead

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:03.840
<i>It </i>is<i> Sakura-san.</i>

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:05.480
<i>Is she here by herself?</i>

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:09.540
<i>Why am I being so sneaky?</i>

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:12.740
<b>Sato</b>

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:12.740
<b>Okonomiyaki
Yakisoba</b>

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:12.740
Next customer, please.

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:16.240
I'm finally inside!

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:32.230
What will you have?

00:16:32.230 --> 00:16:34.230
Oh, um...

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:36.900
Gomoku shigure, boss.

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:38.330
Gomoku shigure here, too.

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:39.190
Sure thing.

00:16:40.380 --> 00:16:41.270
And you?

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:44.200
U-Um...

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:48.430
Same! Gomoku shigure!

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:50.200
All right, gomoku shigure it is.

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:35.440
I-It's almost ready.

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:38.070
Gurgle

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:40.580
<i>Stare...</i>

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:46.510
<i>The home café's up ahead.</i>

00:17:46.930 --> 00:17:48.580
<i>Is that where Sakura-san's going, too?</i>

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:53.160
<i>I'll bump into her if I go now.</i>

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:57.590
I finally have lunch!!

00:17:58.350 --> 00:17:59.840
<i>Nadeshiko...</i>

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:01.320
<i>Don't scare me like that.</i>

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:04.600
Rin-chan?

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:14.110
<i>Shigure-yaki: a local gourmet dish combining 
okonomiyaki and Fujinomiya yakisoba.</i>

00:18:14.910 --> 00:18:17.110
Time to eat!

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:23.270
<i>It's lightly seasoned with sardine 
flakes and Worcestershire sauce.</i>

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:30.090
<i>The meat bits and thick, chewy noodles 
make it a very filling meal.</i>

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:34.090
Yum!

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:43.600
<i>Huh?</i>

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:48.020
<i>Come to think of it, this might be the 
first time I've ever eaten out by myself.</i>

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:51.920
<i>I feel so grown-up ordering for one!</i>

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:55.120
I'd like some oden too, please!

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:56.030
Comin' up.

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:59.700
I'll have a cocoa chiffon and coffee.

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:03.410
<b>Home
Café
Kasaya</b>

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:03.410
And I'll have the perilla cheesecake.

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:18.200
<i>It's... It's so awkward 
without Nadeshiko here.</i>

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:20.550
<i>What should I talk about?</i>

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:23.390
My sister loves that series.

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:25.100
We have the DVDs at home.

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:31.410
I heard from Nadeshiko that 
you like <i>Moped's Journey</i>, too.

00:19:32.320 --> 00:19:33.100
"Too"?

00:19:33.570 --> 00:19:35.760
You like it too, Rin-chan?

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.740
W-We watched it on our camping trip.

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:40.620
Western Japan? Eastern Japan?

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:41.610
The overseas arc?

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:45.190
<i>She really responded to that...</i>

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:47.870
Huh...

00:19:48.150 --> 00:19:51.960
Do you go out for drives often, too?

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:53.060
Occasionally.

00:19:53.060 --> 00:19:55.250
Like to places that get 
featured on travel shows.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.240
Maybe once a month or so.

00:19:57.860 --> 00:20:00.570
<i>Sakura-san's the solo type, too.</i>

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:02.520
Are you camping again?

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:05.110
Yes, by Lake Amehata.

00:20:05.110 --> 00:20:07.380
I haven't decided where to stay yet, though.

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:10.580
You sure are a seasoned traveler.

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:12.740
N-Not at all.

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:18.710
Nadeshiko went camping by herself today, too.

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:24.100
She left with a huge backpack 
early this morning...

00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:27.810
<i>She's definitely worried.</i>

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:31.060
<i>I wonder if I should have 
stopped her from going.</i>

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:46.930
I'm gonna go shopping and then head to the campsite!

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:48.930
<b>Southern Alps Ecological Reserve
Home Café "Kasaya"</b>

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:48.930
<b>"Queen's Bath"
Lake Narada Hot Springs</b>

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:51.550
See you, Rin-chan. Take care.

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:53.310
I will. You too, Sakura-san.

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:57.000
I'll have Nadeshiko bring 
all the DVDs next time.

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:58.590
Th-Thank you.

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:10.830
<b>Queen's Bath</b>

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:24.650
It's a little on the colder side...

00:21:30.740 --> 00:21:34.470
I made it to Fujikawa Station on schedule!

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:38.480
Fujikawa Station

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:38.480
Fujikawa Healthy Greenspace Campsite

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:38.480
1 hour 32 minutes

00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:38.480
It's 5.5 kilometers to the campsite...

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:41.730
And I'm all set for dinner!

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:44.740
I'm all set on everything else, too.

00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:48.800
Okay, time to walk to the campsite!

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:35.260
Next Episode

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:35.260
<b>Camping Alone</b>

00:23:34.780 --> 00:23:41.260
When camping...

00:23:34.780 --> 00:23:41.260
Always mind the campsite 
and facility rules. Don't forget to 
take care of fires and your trash!

00:23:34.780 --> 00:23:41.260
It gets cold during the winter. 
Stay warm and be well-prepared!

00:23:34.780 --> 00:23:41.260
Outdoor Activities Club
